Build RPM packages with:

    bash packaging/build-all.sh
    bash packaging/build-rpm.sh amd64   # or arm64, armhf, i386, riscv64

The payload matches the Debian package plus boot/SSH hooks. Architectures
use RPM names (x86_64, aarch64, armv7hl, i686, riscv64). Packages are
unsigned; `ker upgrade --trust-package` is required. Do not install on
the production host that already runs ker-guard.
